    "long_instructions": "# Render Your Data Cards\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll build the first version of your app interface and display your dataset using `.map()`.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Use your wireframe to build the page layout and one card design.\r\n\r\n2. Use `.map()` to render your dataset as cards on the page.\r\n\r\n3. Test your app.\r\n   - Does each item create one card?\r\n   - Does each card show the correct information?\r\n   - Are the labels clear and easy to understand?\r\n\r\nFocus on getting your dataset to display clearly before adding search, filter, or sort features.",
